{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What happened to Kamilia?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535500/extras/About_A2.jpg?t=1745432107\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a short glimpse into Kamilia -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique detective mystery, that follows the story of a talented painter, as he finds himself involved in an ongoing murder investigation that was left unsolved for years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535500/extras/About_E.jpg?t=1745432107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 1909, a dramatic event shook the entire town of Roga and started a chain of events that led to an unsolvable crime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 years later, it is up to you to learn the truth, and clear the unsettling shadows of death that took over Roga. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535500/extras/About_B.jpg?t=1745432107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you'll jump into a mid-section of the story to experience a limited chapter that offers a taste of the mystery to come\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535500?t=1745432107","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745432107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535500/8a2251f5baeefa6fd2cc9775ae7fbcfb732aaa81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745432107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535500/8a2251f5baeefa6fd2cc9775ae7fbcfb732aaa81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745432107","categories":[{"description":"Single-pla